  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-smithing-tables.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Smithing-Tables\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h1>Больше кузниц</h1><p>Украсьте свои постройки разноцветными инструментами и бронёй — теперь у каждого типа древесины есть своя собственная кузница.</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Smithing-Tables/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>Добавление 12 новых <em>Столов кузнеца</em> в Minecraft.</h2><hr><h1>Совместимость с заменой блоков от <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+:</h1><p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/wfhve.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\nГлядя из окна дома кузнеца в деревне на равнине на рыбацкую хижину: мы видим, что вместо обычного <em>Стола кузнеца</em>, <em>Еловых бочек</em> и обычного <em>Сундука</em>, игра теперь генерирует деревню с <em><strong>Дубовым Столом кузнеца</strong></em>, <em><strong>Дубовыми бочками</strong></em> (из мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-barrel-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Barrel Variants</a>) и <em><strong>Дубовым сундуком</strong></em> (из мода <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-chest-variants-lieonlion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Chest Variants</a>).</p><hr><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
